Third-party data

Skip segments (an optional setting, off by default):
Uses SponsorBlock data licensed used under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 from
https://sponsor.ajay.app/

Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

While the setting is on, the app downloads segment timings from SponsorBlock
as each video starts and keeps them in memory only. No SponsorBlock data is
included in the app or in this repository. The data may not be used for
commercial purposes, so any paid distribution of the app would need this
feature removed or SponsorBlock's permission.
